  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d1144f89f22e429abc53db6888903c4, type: 3}
  m_Name: IntroScript
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - "Memories come in a variety of forms. They are tied to the people we cherish,
    the pictures we take, the sounds we hear, and the aromas of our day. Oftentimes,
    memories are tied to the places we\u2019ve been."
  - 'This is an experience that requires you to reflect on your memories and may
    require you to be vulnerable at times. '
  - "Your responses are anonymous and will be saved in our digital archive for future
    Mustangs. Take this experience seriously and respect other people\u2019s words
    and emotions. "
  - "Put as much or as little as you feel appropriate. There will be three prompts
    so feel free to write as much as it resonates with you. If you need to step out
    of the experience at anytime,  please do so. We\u2019ll always be here for you!"
  - The pages of this book have yet to be written, and only you know its story.
